000010 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000020 PROGRAM-ID. RELEASE1.
000030 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000040 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
000050 FILE-CONTROL.
000060     SELECT WORK-F ASSIGN TO "sortwork".
000070 DATA DIVISION.
000080 FILE SECTION.
000090 SD  WORK-F.
000100 01  WORK-REC.
000110     05  W-WORD          PIC X(8).
000120 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000130 01  SENTENCE-TEXT       PIC X(40)
000140     VALUE "THE QUICK BROWN FOX JUMPS OVER THE DOG".
